\newlabel{fig:boundary_schematic}{{2}{2}{Schematic illustration of the expected boundary profile. Note the discontinuities in some thermodynamic properties at the phase boundary located at $x=0$, followed by relaxation to beta equilibrium as $x\to \infty $. \mga {In the adiabatic case, temperature will also show a discontinuity at $x=0$ followed by relaxation to an asymptotic value as $x\to \infty $.}}{figure.caption.5}{}}
